  "description": "<p>The GitHub actions workflow “Rebuild latest release image version” seems to build Docker images in the deploy job, but never pushes them to Docker Hub.</p>\n\n<p>The script <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-docker/blob/main/build-and-push-to-dockerhub.sh\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">build-and-push-to-dockerhub.sh from fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-docker</a> used to build the Docker image, only pushes the Image to Docker Hub, when the command line flag <tt>--push</tt> as been specified. This flag is currently missing in the workflow.</p>",
